SimulationType                MonteCarlo
NumberOfCycles                10000
NumberOfInitializationCycles  5000
PrintEvery                    1000

Forcefield                    Local
RemoveAtomNumberCodeFromLabel no
CutOffVDW                     12.0
ChargeMethod                  ewald
EwaldPrecision                1e-6
OmitAdsorbateAdsorbateCoulombInteractions no

Framework 0
